       "settings": {
        "tabs": [
         {
          "_id": "a3712d8",
          "tab_title": "What's the difference between Plan 1 and Business?",
          "tab_content": "<p>Exchange Online Plan 1 is business email: a 50GB mailbox, shared calendars, contacts and tasks, webmail and the Android and Apple apps.</p><p>Microsoft 365 Business gives you a 100GB mailbox and adds the Office apps (web and desktop) and SpamExperts spam and virus filtering. It comes in Basic, Standard and Premium tiers.</p>"
         },
         {
          "_id": "6d11744",
          "tab_title": "Can I mix basic email and Microsoft 365 across my team?",
          "tab_content": "<p>Often, yes, depending on how your email is set up. Call us on <a href=\"tel:+61863654522\">08 6365 4522</a> and we'll tell you what works for your domain and your team.</p>"
         },
         {
          "_id": "1718020",
          "tab_title": "Do you move my existing mailboxes across?",
          "tab_content": "<p>Yes. Send us a <a href=\"/support/microsoft-transfer-request/\">Microsoft Transfer Request</a> and our Perth team will plan the move with you.</p>"
         },
         {
          "_id": "7c61874",
          "tab_title": "How long does it take to set up a licence?",
          "tab_content": "<p>Licences are set up by hand during business hours (Mon to Fri, 8:30am to 5:30pm Perth time).</p>"
         },
         {
          "_id": "3383a92",
          "tab_title": "Can I add or remove licences later?",
          "tab_content": "<p>Yes. Microsoft 365 is charged per licence, so just let us know when your team changes and we'll adjust it.</p>"
         }
        ],
        "selected_icon": {
         "value": "fas fa-plus",
         "library": "fa-solid"
        },
        "selected_active_icon": {
         "value": "fas fa-minus",
